! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVPD RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO AutoAux
# GAS-PHASE control: identical 44-atom anion, method, basis and geometry;
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 5
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
  DoSTEOMNatTransOrb true
  # Retry fix: the first attempt died with "Solution of the EA=EOM-DLPNO-CCSD
  # equations failed" after "high double excitation character, excluding from
  # the STEOM transformation". Loosening the active-space selection thresholds
  # is the documented remedy for this failure on this system.
  OThresh 1e-4
  VThresh 1e-4
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_cthrp.xyz
